l. She should feel like a mature, dominant, high-ranking female character making her entrance.\n\nHer movement should be graceful but authoritative. She walks with a steady rhythm, and the motion should clearly show a strong “character debut” feeling. Her body has subtle natural movement while walking. Her long dress sways gently, her hair moves slightly, and the chained weapons around her show light dynamic motion. The chain sections should swing or sway a little with her steps, and the bladed weapon parts should have subtle motion, as if they are alive or responding to her power. The weapon movement should not be exaggerated, but it should feel active and dangerous.\n\nThe camera should feel like a polished game trailer shot: slow cinematic push-in, elegant tracking, medium shot to medium-full shot framing, highlighting her face, upper body, dress details, weapon design, and the slight movement of the chained blades. The pacing should feel like a premium game character reveal.\n\nThe character speaks in Chinese while walking, in a confident, elegant, mature “御姐” voice. Her tone should be calm, dominant, slightly cold, and full of pressure, like a powerful game character making her first appearance.\n\nDialogue:\n(S1) <d>[Chinese] 终于，轮到我登场了。</d>\n(S1) <d>[Chinese] 记住我的名字……因为接下来，将由我主宰战场。</d>\n(S1) <d>[Chinese] 若你还想反抗，那就尽管试试看吧。</d>\n\nAudio design should be very important. Include clear high-heel footsteps with a crisp, elegant rhythm. Add layered chain sound effects and subtle metallic weapon movement sounds that match her steps and weapon motion. The chained blades should produce light dragging, swaying, or metallic clinking sounds. Add a dark, stylish, premium fantasy game ambience in the background, with subtle tension, low cinematic atmosphere, and elegant character-introduction music. The overall sound should feel like a polished game trailer: confident, stylish, dangerous, and dramatic.\n\nThe final result should feel like a premium fantasy action game character reveal: elegant, dominant, stylish, slightly dangerous, and visually impressive. No subtitles, no watermark, no extra characters, no deformed anatomy, no exaggerated comedy motion."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "正向提示词 / Positive Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1515.83984375, 6018.734375], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [317], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [0], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "音频开始时间 / Audio Start Time", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1075.241455078125, 5692.42041015625], "id": 154, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [318], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [10.000000000000002], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "音频持续时间 / Audio Duration", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1075.241455078125, 5792.42041015625], "id": 155, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "runninghub_app": {"input_order": [{"node_type": "ResolutionSelector", "title": "输出比例 / Asp